sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as 客户端(儿童/家长)
    participant AC as AuthController
    participant FC as FamilyController
    participant CC as ComplianceController
    participant AS as AuthService
    participant FS as FamilyService
    participant CS as ComplianceService
    participant WC as WechatClient
    participant JWT as JwtUtil
    participant MP as Mapper/DB
    participant RDS as Redis(黑名单)
    participant AUD as AuditService

    Note over C,MP: === 全链路：登录 → 角色 → 档案 → 家庭 → 绑定 → 同意 ===

    rect rgb(239,246,255)
    Note over C,MP: ① 微信登录 (公开接口，过拦截器但无 token)
    C->>AC: POST /api/auth/wx-login {code}
    AC->>AS: wxLogin(code)
    AS->>WC: code2Session(code)
    WC-->>AS: openid
    AS->>MP: 查/建 usr_user(role=UNSET)
    AS->>JWT: issue(userId,UNSET,[])
    JWT-->>AS: token
    AS->>AUD: record(LOGIN)
    AS-->>C: {token, openid, role:UNSET, isNew}
    end

    rect rgb(240,253,244)
    Note over C,MP: ② 角色选择 (CHILD / PARENT)
    C->>AC: POST /api/auth/select-role {role} + Bearer
    AC->>AS: selectRole(role)
    AS->>MP: UPDATE usr_user.role
    AS->>JWT: reissue(userId,role,[])
    JWT-->>AS: newToken
    AS-->>C: {role, token:newToken, nextStep}
    end

    rect rgb(254,252,242)
    Note over C,MP: ③ 儿童档案 (仅 CHILD)
    C->>AC: POST /api/child/profile {...} + Bearer
    AC->>AS: saveChildProfile(req)
    AS->>MP: INSERT/UPDATE usr_child_profile(profile_status=COMPLETED)
    AS-->>C: {profileStatus:COMPLETED}
    end

    rect rgb(239,246,255)
    Note over C,MP: ④ 家庭创建 + 邀请码 (仅 PARENT)
    C->>FC: POST /api/family/create {familyName} + Bearer
    FC->>FS: createFamily(req)
    FS->>MP: INSERT usr_family(invite_code,expire)
    FS->>MP: INSERT usr_family_member(PARENT,APPROVED)
    FS->>JWT: reissue(写入 family_ids=[familyId])
    FS->>AUD: record(CREATE_FAMILY)
    FS-->>C: {familyId, inviteCode, expireAt, token:newToken}
    C->>FC: GET /api/family/invite-code + Bearer
    FC->>FS: getInviteCode()
    FS-->>C: {inviteCode, expireAt}
    end

    rect rgb(254,242,242)
    Note over C,MP: ⑤ 儿童加入 + ⑥ 家长绑定审批
    C->>FC: POST /api/family/join {inviteCode} + Bearer(CHILD)
    FC->>FS: joinFamily(req)
    FS->>MP: 校验 invite_code/expire → INSERT usr_family_member(CHILD,PENDING)
    FS-->>C: {applyId, status:PENDING}
    C->>FC: POST /api/family/bind-approve {applyId,approve} + Bearer(PARENT)
    FC->>FS: bindApprove(req)
    FS->>MP: UPDATE usr_family_member(APPROVED/REJECTED)
    FS->>AUD: record(BIND)
    FS-->>C: {bindStatus}
    end

    rect rgb(240,253,244)
    Note over C,MP: ⑦ 监护人同意提交 (含自报年龄核验)
    C->>CC: POST /api/compliance/consent {version, selfReportedAge, agreed} + Bearer(PARENT)
    CC->>CS: submitConsent(req)
    alt selfReportedAge < 18
        CS-->>C: BizException(E004 监护人核验失败) 400
    else 通过
        CS->>MP: INSERT usr_consent_log(GRANT, APPROVED)
        CS->>AUD: record(GRANT)
        CS-->>C: {guardianStatus:APPROVED}
    end
    end

    Note over C,RDS: === 撤回即时降级 (E-010) ===
    rect rgb(254,242,242)
    C->>CC: POST /api/compliance/consent/revoke {consentType,childId} + Bearer(PARENT)
    CC->>CS: revokeConsent(req)
    CS->>MP: UPDATE usr_consent_log(REVOKE, REVOKED)
    CS->>RDS: SET jwt:blacklist:{jti} TTL=剩余有效期
    CS->>AUD: record(REVOKE)
    CS-->>C: BizException(E010 已撤回,能力降级) 409 / 或 {status:REVOKED}
    Note right of RDS: 该家长后续请求被拦截器查黑名单 → 401(E001)，儿童端被降级
    end
